      of Software Engineering (FSE '10)
    year: 2010
    doi: 10.1145/1882291.1882308
    notes: >-
      Measures the bug-side complement of commit-side linkage. Whether the
      ticket realisation rate defined in paper/manuscript/method.md §3.1 is the
